# Cloudflare Pages production build. This is a public URL (no secrets): the
# marketplace Worker at packages/trpc-api, deployed as `pymeshub-api-staging`
# (wrangler.toml). Mirrors the fallback in client/src/lib/marketplace.ts so the
# deploy is explicit and survives that fallback changing.
#
# CORS note: the Worker only allows browser origins listed in its `CORS_ORIGINS`
# var — `https://staging.pymeshub.lat` in staging, `https://pymeshub.lat` and
# `https://www.pymeshub.lat` in production. Serving this app from any other
# origin makes every storefront request fail with no ACAO header.
VITE_MARKETPLACE_API_URL=https://api-staging.pymeshub.lat
